      "name": "LoadDirectDrawLibrary",
      "signature": "void LoadDirectDrawLibrary(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Dynamically loads DDRAW.DLL and retrieves the DirectDrawCreate function pointer.\n\n  Algorithm:\n    1. Save current error mode and set SEM_FAILCRITICALERRORS (0x8000)\n    2. Load DDRAW.DLL via LoadLibraryA\n    3. Restore original error mode\n    4. Check if module handle is valid (> 0x1f (31))\n    5. If valid, get DirectDrawCreate function address via GetProcAddress\n    6. If invalid, set module handle to 0x1 as sentinel value\n\n  Parameters:\n    None\n\n  Returns:\n    void - Results stored in globals:\n      g_hDDrawModule: HMODULE of loaded DDRAW.DLL or 0x1 on failure\n      g_pfnDirectDrawCreate: Function pointer to DirectDrawCreate or unchanged on failure\n\n  Special Cases:\n    - Uses SEM_FAILCRITICALERRORS to suppress system error dialogs\n    - Handle values <= 0x1f (31) are error codes, not valid module handles\n    - Sets g_hDDrawModule to 0x1 as sentinel to indicate failed load attempt",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:60b786edb4e14e02992e95a5d91b9455",
