      "name": "ProcessStreamQueue",
      "signature": "void ProcessStreamQueue(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Process all active stream buffers, copying pending data and managing queue state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Load linked list head from g_pStreamQueueHead (global stream queue)\n  2. For each stream in queue (iterate via [ESI+0x3C] next pointer):\n     a. Call state query callback on stream handle (g_pfnQueryStreamState)\n     b. If active, set stream flagged bit (offset 0x58)\n     c. Check transfer conditions: data pending, state valid (< 2), etc.\n     d. Call size query callback (g_pfnGetBufferState) to get buffer state (0 or 1)\n     e. Align pending bytes: cbSize = size & 0xFFFFFFFC, cap to available\n     f. If no timestamp set (offset 0x7C), call timeGetTime() and store\n     g. Accumulate pending bytes to running total (offset 0x60)\n     h. Copy data via MemoryCopyRegions from appropriate buffer\n     i. Call update callback (g_pfnUpdateStreamBuffer) with buffer index and size\n     j. Update position/size fields (offset 0x78, 0x10)\n  3. After all streams processed, call cleanup callback (g_pfnCleanupQueue)\n\nParameters:\n  (void) - No parameters. Operates on global stream queue g_pStreamQueueHead\n\nReturns:\n  void - Always succeeds, no return value\n\nStructure Layout (stream element at ESI):\n  Offset | Size | Field              | Type | Description\n  0x0    | 4    | pData              | void*| Destination buffer pointer\n  0x4    | 4    | cbRemaining        | uint | Bytes still to transfer\n  0x8    | 4    | pSource            | void*| Source buffer pointer\n  0x10   | 4    | dwState            | uint | Stream state/handle\n  0x1D   | 4    | dwThreshold        | uint | Minimum before transfer\n  0x1E   | 4    | cbPending          | uint | Bytes accumulated\n  0x1F   | 4    | dwTimestamp        | DWORD| Last transfer time (via timeGetTime)\n  0x20   | 4    | dwFlags            | uint | Control flags\n  0x3C   | 4    | pNext              | ptr  | Next stream in linked list\n  0x40   | 4    | dwHandle           | uint | Handle passed to callbacks\n  0x44   | 4    | cbMaxTransfer      | uint | Max bytes per transfer (aligned)\n  0x58   | 4    | dwFlaggedBit       | uint | Active stream marker\n  0x60   | 4    | cbTransferred      | uint | Total bytes transferred\n  0x74   | 4    | dwMinSize          | uint | Minimum data check (offset 0x1D field)\n  0x78   | 4    | cbPendingDelta     | uint | Accumulation value\n  0x7C   | 4    | dwTimeoutVal       | DWORD| Current timeout reference\n  0x80   | 4    | dwFlagField        | uint | Condition flag\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Empty queue: g_pStreamQueueHead is NULL, function skips directly to cleanup\n  - No valid transfer: Complex multi-condition check at 0x10007C63\n  - Alignment: All transfer sizes aligned to 4-byte boundary (& 0xFFFFFFFC)",
