      "name": "InitializeDirectSoundAudio",
      "signature": "BOOL InitializeDirectSoundAudio(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "BOOL",
      "comment": "Initializes DirectSound audio for Smacker video playback.\n\n  Called as a callback from Smacker sound initialization to set up DirectSound.\n  If audio manager is already initialized, returns success immediately.\n\n  Algorithm:\n    1. Check if g_pAudioManager is already initialized - if so, skip to success\n    2. Call DirectSoundCreate() to create DirectSound object\n    3. If creation fails, output debug error message and return FALSE (AL=0)\n    4. Find appropriate window handle for DirectSound:\n       a. Use g_hDirectSoundHWND if already set\n       b. Otherwise enumerate windows to find one owned by current process\n       c. Fall back to GetActiveWindow() if no matching window found\n    5. Set g_bAudioInitialized = 1\n    6. Call _SmackSoundSetDirectSoundHWND to set cooperative level\n    7. Set g_dwAudioResetFlag = 1\n    8. Return TRUE (AL=1)\n\n  Parameters:\n    None\n\n  Returns:\n    BOOL - TRUE (1) on success, FALSE (0) if DirectSoundCreate fails\n\n  Global State:\n    - g_pAudioManager: Receives DirectSound object pointer\n    - g_hDirectSoundHWND: Cached HWND for DirectSound (input)\n    - g_bAudioInitialized: Set to 1 on success\n    - g_dwAudioResetFlag: Set to 1 on success\n    - g_bDebugAudio: If 0x01, enables debug output on error\n\n  Called By:\n    - _SmackSoundUseDirectSound (as g_pfnSmackSoundCallback)\n    - FUN_10009b40",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:c2ee70ea5c17d2be9a26b84207122038",
