      "name": "InvokeOptionalHandler",
      "signature": "int InvokeOptionalHandler(int nParam)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Invokes optional handler function pointer if configured.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Load handler function pointer from global g_pfnOptionalHandler (0x10015d64)\n  2. If handler is NULL, return 0\n  3. Call handler with dwParam parameter\n  4. Test return value for non-zero result\n  5. Return 1 if handler returned non-zero, 0 otherwise\n\nParameters:\n  dwParam - Handler-specific parameter value\n\nReturns:\n  1 if handler was invoked and returned non-zero\n  0 if handler was NULL or returned zero\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  If g_pfnOptionalHandler is NULL, function short-circuits and returns 0\n  Handler function is called with stdcall convention (ECX = dwParam)",
